sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as API Client
    participant GS as Guardrails Server<br/>8033/TCP HTTP/HTTPS
    participant GenTGIS as TGIS Generation<br/>8033/TCP gRPC
    participant GenOpenAI as OpenAI Service<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant Chunker as Chunker Service<br/>8085/TCP gRPC
    participant Detector as Detector Service<br/>8080/TCP HTTP

    Note over Client,Detector: Flow 1: Text Content Detection
    Client->>GS: POST /api/v2/text/detection/content<br/>TLS (optional), Passthrough headers
    GS->>Chunker: ChunkRequest (gRPC)<br/>TLS (optional)
    Chunker-->>GS: Chunked text segments
    GS->>Detector: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>TLS (optional), Bearer token
    Note right of GS: Concurrent fan-out<br/>max 5 requests
    Detector-->>GS: Detection results
    GS-->>Client: Aggregated detection response

    Note over Client,Detector: Flow 2: Generation with Detection
    Client->>GS: POST /api/v2/text/generation-detection<br/>TLS (optional), Passthrough headers
    GS->>GenTGIS: BatchedGenerationRequest (gRPC)<br/>TLS (optional), Retry on 502/503/504
    GenTGIS-->>GS: Generated text
    GS->>Chunker: ChunkRequest (gRPC)<br/>TLS (optional)
    Chunker-->>GS: Chunked text segments
    GS->>Detector: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>TLS (optional), Bearer token
    Detector-->>GS: Detection results
    GS-->>Client: Generation + detection response

    Note over Client,Detector: Flow 3: Chat Completions Detection (OpenAI)
    Client->>GS: POST /api/v2/chat/completions-detection<br/>TLS (optional), Passthrough headers
    GS->>GenOpenAI: POST /chat/completions<br/>TLS (optional), Bearer token
    GenOpenAI-->>GS: Chat completion response
    GS->>Detector: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>TLS (optional), Bearer token
    Detector-->>GS: Detection results
    GS-->>Client: SSE or JSON response
